  "draw": "census: all 95 witnesses of census.json, in order",
  "transcript": "Canonical serialisation uses recursive sorted keys with no whitespace. The proposal artifact is serialised to proposal_canon.json by sorting all object keys alphabetically at every level, removing all whitespace, and producing a single-line JSON string. A third party re-derives hProposal by running sha256sum on proposal_canon.json; the seed is then derived as sha256(hProposal + salt) where hProposal = b65b1d7467d62bbd0db323b02693d58b8cd376237b318f344eec1b77615b4f23 and salt = 61b8b36893e9760ad9583477e6dc9480fa3b557f1a12cd3846b8b4297e35cd5c, yielding seedHex = a2ffa1c9ab8150204e1f4d067baa9b5883980a004db6537e9c4129a8b035e7e2. The draw rule is deterministic census: all 95 witnesses from census.json in declaration order, without replacement."
